            <span style="font-size: 12pt;">“The State of California offers a comprehensive benefits package that includes health, vision, dental, a retirement pension, a telework stipend if applicable, and an array of other options.” <br /><br />Benefit information can be found on the <a href="https://www.calhr.ca.gov/Pages/California-State-Civil-Service-Employee-Benefits-Summary.aspx">CalHR</a> website and the <a href="https://www.calpers.ca.gov/">CalPERS</a> website.</span>
